{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-01-13 06:30:00', 'title': "LINDE TO BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE WORLD'S LARGEST PEM ELECTROLYZER FOR GREEN HYDROGEN", 'text': "GUILFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 13, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE THE WORLD'S LARGEST PEM (PROTON EXCHANGE MEMBRANE) ELECTROLYZER PLANT AT THE LEUNA CHEMICAL COMPLEX IN GERMANY. THE NEW 24-MEGAWATT ELECTROLYZER WILL PRODUCE GREEN HYDROGEN TO SUPPLY LINDE'S INDUSTRIAL CUSTOMERS THROUGH THE COMPANY'S EXISTING PIPELINE NETWORK."}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-01-13 06:00:00', 'title': "ITM POWER PLC ANNOUNCES SALE TO LINDE OF WORLD'S LARGEST PEM ELECTROLYSER", 'text': 'SHEFFIELD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 13, 2021 / ITM POWER (AIM: ITM), THE ENERGY STORAGE AND CLEAN FUEL COMPANY, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THE SALE TO LINDE OF A 24MW ELECTROLYSER TO BE INSTALLED AT THE LEUNA CHEMICAL COMPLEX IN GERMANY. THE FULL TEXT OF THE LINDE ANNOUNCEMENT IS SET OUT BELOW.'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-01-13 06:30:00', 'title': "LINDE TO BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE WORLD'S LARGEST PEM ELECTROLYZER FOR GREEN HYDROGEN", 'text': "GUILFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 13, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE THE WORLD'S LARGEST PEM (PROTON EXCHANGE MEMBRANE) ELECTROLYZER PLANT AT THE LEUNA CHEMICAL COMPLEX IN GERMANY. THE NEW 24-MEGAWATT ELECTROLYZER WILL PRODUCE GREEN HYDROGEN TO SUPPLY LINDE'S INDUSTRIAL CUSTOMERS THROUGH THE COMPANY'S EXISTING PIPELINE NETWORK."}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-01-13 06:00:00', 'title': "ITM POWER PLC ANNOUNCES SALE TO LINDE OF WORLD'S LARGEST PEM ELECTROLYSER", 'text': 'SHEFFIELD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 13, 2021 / ITM POWER (AIM: ITM), THE ENERGY STORAGE AND CLEAN FUEL COMPANY, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THE SALE TO LINDE OF A 24MW ELECTROLYSER TO BE INSTALLED AT THE LEUNA CHEMICAL COMPLEX IN GERMANY. THE FULL TEXT OF THE LINDE ANNOUNCEMENT IS SET OUT BELOW.'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-01-13 06:30:00', 'ti